{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Adjoint $[2,1,0]^2$: the clean combination, analytically\n\nThe goal is to derive the clean site-1 combination exactly, as a function of $t=\\theta_{12}/h$, by small-twist perturbation theory. It was found numerically in `Minimal-ingredients-EH.wb` Section 7 (fitted $\\beta=h(2t-3)/(t-1)$). Self-contained; the first code cell clears the (shared) kernel. The computation is exact: plain $E$ basis (rational, no surds; all ratios are basis-independent), $h=1$, $\\theta_1=t$, $\\theta_2=0$, with $t$ symbolic.\n\n**Setup.** Twists $z=e^{\\varepsilon\\varphi}$, $w=e^{\\varepsilon\\omega}$. The insertions are $X_\\lambda=T_\\lambda(\\theta_1-2h)/f_\\lambda$ for $\\lambda=(1,1),(2,1)$, with covectors $W_\\lambda=\\langle\\Omega|T_\\lambda$. The Q-side numbers are top-killed: $(X^B-X^{\\rm top})\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$. For a HW-limit state, $\\Psi=h+\\varepsilon\\psi_1+O(\\varepsilon^2)$.\n\n**Why only first order is needed.** $\\Omega(\\varepsilon)$ always lies in the 27, and at $\\varepsilon=0$ the untwisted $T_\\lambda$ acts on the 27 by the top eigenvalue. Hence $(W_\\lambda-T_\\lambda^{\\rm top}\\Omega)$ vanishes at $\\varepsilon^0$ on the whole weight sector. Also $\\Omega\\cdot h=0$ for $h\\notin27$. So:\n- **Signal:** $S_\\lambda=W_\\lambda(\\varepsilon)\\cdot h$.\n- **Contamination:** $K_\\lambda=\\varepsilon^2\\,(W_\\lambda-T^{\\rm top}_\\lambda\\Omega)_1\\cdot\\psi_1+O(\\varepsilon^3)$.\n- **States whose signal starts at $O(\\varepsilon)$** ($[4,1,1]$, $[3,3,0]$, octets) are clean after top-killing, automatically.\n- **The singlet:** its signal starts at $\\varepsilon^2$ and $S_{(1,1)}\\equiv0$. The clean ratio is $\\beta=-\\frac{K_{(2,1)}/f_{(2,1)}}{K_{(1,1)}/f_{(1,1)}}$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll @@ Select[Names[\"Global`*\"], FreeQ[Attributes[#], Protected] &];\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nΛ = {2, 1, 0}; d1 = dim[Λ]; d2 = d1^2; id1 = IdentityMatrix[d1];\nEJ[i_, j_] := EJ[i, j] = JJ[i, j, Λ];\nEtot[i_, j_] := Etot[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[EJ[i, j], id1] + KroneckerProduct[id1, EJ[i, j]];\nwtBasis = Flatten[Table[Table[J0[k][p1] + J0[k][p2], {k, 3}], {p1, ps[{Λ}]}, {p2, ps[{Λ}]}], 1];\nsecOf[μ_] := secOf[μ] = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, μ]];\nkron[a_, b_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[a, b]];\ne1 = UnitVector[d1, 1];\nnexp[A_] := id1 + Sum[MatrixPower[A, k]/k!, {k, 1, 4}];\n(* h = 1, θ1 = tt, θ2 = 0; twist diag(zz) on the right, zz symbolic *)\nthS = {tt, 0};\nlaxS[s_, x_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, j] (x - thS[[s]]) SparseArray[id1] + SparseArray[EJ[i, j]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\nlax2S[x_] := lax2S[x] = With[{L1 = laxS[1, x], L2 = laxS[2, x]}, Table[Sum[KroneckerProduct[L1[[i, k]], L2[[k, j]]], {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\nmonoS[x_] := Table[lax2S[x][[i, j]] zz[j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\ntS[a_, x_] := tS[a, x] = Expand[Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[monoS[x - (k - 1)][[σ[[k]], rows[[k]]]], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[rows]}], {rows, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}]];\nu1 = tt - 2;\n{tBuild, ops} = AbsoluteTiming[<|\"11\" -> tS[2, u1], \"21\" -> Expand[tS[2, u1] . tS[1, u1 + 1] - tS[3, u1 + 1]], \"mix\" -> tS[1, 3/7]|>];\nGrid[{{\"dims\", {d1, d2}}, {\"build time (s)\", tBuild}, {\"T21 entries are polynomials in\", Variables[Normal[ops[\"21\"]][[1, 1]]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"942214\" data-output-id=\"77\" data-out-n=\"839\" data-sub-idx=\"23\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"28\" data-sub-end=\"28\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[839]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dims</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">build time (s)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T21 entries are polynomials in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.041622</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">tt</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">zz</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">zz</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">zz</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
