  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. First-order perturbation theory, exact in $t$\nFor a multiplicity-1 HW state of weight $\\mu$, everything is restricted to the weight sector:\n- **$\\psi_1$.** With $M=t_1(3/7)$ (the singlet is nondegenerate for it), solve $(M_0-m_0)\\psi_1=-(M_1-m_1)h$ with $\\ell\\cdot\\psi_1=0$, where $\\ell$ is the left eigenvector and $m_1=\\ell M_1h/\\ell h$. Here $M_1=\\sum_j\\varphi_j\\partial_{z_j}M|_{z=1}$.\n- **Signal.** $S_\\lambda(\\varepsilon)=\\Omega(\\varepsilon)\\cdot T_\\lambda(\\varepsilon)h$, expanded to $\\varepsilon^2$.\n- **Top-killed covector.** $(W_\\lambda-T_\\lambda^{\\rm top}\\Omega)(\\varepsilon)$, expanded to $\\varepsilon^1$; the cell checks that the $\\varepsilon^0$ part vanishes. The top eigenvalue is the $(1,1)$ entry, since $e_1\\otimes e_1$ is an eigenvector.\n- **Contamination.** $K_\\lambda=\\varepsilon^2(\\ldots)_1\\cdot\\psi_1$.\n\nThe twist directions $(\\varphi,\\omega)$ are numeric rationals, two different pairs, so the result can be checked for direction independence.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "rOm[zv_, wv_] := {(wv[[1]] - zv[[1]])/(wv[[1]] - zv[[2]]),\n   ((wv[[1]] - zv[[1]]) (zv[[1]] - wv[[2]]) (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (wv[[1]] - zv[[3]]) (wv[[2]] - zv[[3]])),\n   ((wv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[2]] - wv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]]))/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (wv[[1]] - zv[[3]]) (zv[[3]] - wv[[2]]))};\nOm1S[zv_, wv_] := With[{r = rOm[zv, wv]}, e1 . nexp[r[[1]] EJ[1, 2]] . nexp[r[[2]] EJ[1, 3]] . nexp[r[[3]] EJ[2, 3]]];\nfS = <|\"11\" -> (tt - 1) (tt - 3), \"21\" -> (tt - 1)^2 (tt - 3)|>;\ncoef[e_, n_] := Together[SeriesCoefficient[e, {ε, 0, n}]];\nanalyse[μ_, φv_, ωv_] := Module[{sec = secOf[μ], h, n, M, M0, M1, m0, lv, m1, ψ1, cs, zE, wE, Ωs, out = <||>, kk, sol},\n   n = Length[sec]; h = First[NullSpace[Join[Etot[1, 2][[All, sec]], Etot[2, 3][[All, sec]]]]];\n   M = Normal[ops[\"mix\"]][[sec, sec]]; M0 = M /. zz[_] -> 1; M1 = Sum[φv[[j]] D[M, zz[j]], {j, 3}] /. zz[_] -> 1;\n   kk = First[Ordering[Abs[h], -1]]; m0 = Together[(M0 . h)[[kk]]/h[[kk]]];\n   lv = First[NullSpace[Transpose[M0 - m0 IdentityMatrix[n]]]]; m1 = Together[lv . M1 . h/(lv . h)];\n   cs = Array[cc, n]; sol = First[Solve[Join[Thread[(M0 - m0 IdentityMatrix[n]) . cs == -(M1 . h - m1 h)], {lv . cs == 0}], cs]]; ψ1 = Together[cs /. sol];\n   zE = Exp[ε φv]; wE = Exp[ε ωv];\n   Ωs = With[{o = Om1S[zE, wE]}, kron[o, o][[sec]]];\n   Do[With[{T = Normal[ops[λ]], Tsec = Normal[ops[λ]][[sec, sec]] /. Thread[Array[zz, 3] -> zE]}, With[{top = T[[1, 1]] /. Thread[Array[zz, 3] -> zE]},\n      out[λ] = <|\"S\" -> Table[coef[Ωs . Tsec . h, k], {k, 0, 2}],\n        \"Kcov0\" -> Simplify[coef[#, 0] & /@ (Ωs . Tsec - top Ωs)],\n        \"K2\" -> Together[(coef[#, 1] & /@ (Ωs . Tsec - top Ωs)) . ψ1]|>]], {λ, {\"11\", \"21\"}}];\n   out[\"eig-res\"] = Simplify[(M0 - m0 IdentityMatrix[n]) . h]; out[\"psi1-res\"] = Simplify[(M0 - m0 IdentityMatrix[n]) . ψ1 + (M1 . h - m1 h)];\n   out];\n{tA, an} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[{μ, analyse[μ, {1/3, -2/7, 5/11}, {3/4, -1/5, 2/9}]}, {μ, {{2, 2, 2}, {3, 3, 0}, {4, 1, 1}}}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"λ\", \"signal S: orders ε^0, ε^1, ε^2 (zero?)\", \"top-killed covector at ε^0 vanishes?\", \"K at ε^2 is zero?\", \"h eigenvector & ψ1 equation residuals zero?\"}},\n   Flatten[Table[{a[[1]], λ, (TrueQ[Simplify[#] == 0] &) /@ a[[2, λ, \"S\"]], AllTrue[a[[2, λ, \"Kcov0\"]], TrueQ[# == 0] &], TrueQ[Simplify[a[[2, λ, \"K2\"]]] == 0], AllTrue[Join[a[[2, \"eig-res\"]], a[[2, \"psi1-res\"]]], TrueQ[# == 0] &]}, {a, an}, {λ, {\"11\", \"21\"}}], 1], {{\"time (s)\", tA, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"942214\" data-output-id=\"80\" data-out-n=\"860\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"21\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[860]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"27\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.64em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose deli