  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the singlet: β = -(K21/f21)/(K11/f11), exact in t, for two different twist-direction pairs *)\nan2 = analyse[{2, 2, 2}, {-2/5, 3/8, 7/11}, {1/9, 5/4, -3/7}];\nsing1 = an[[1, 2]];\nβof[a_] := Factor[-(a[\"21\", \"K2\"]/fS[\"21\"])/(a[\"11\", \"K2\"]/fS[\"11\"])];\nβA = βof[sing1]; βB = βof[an2];\n(* also: the ratio of the contamination to the signal of (2,1) alone (κ - 1 of the plain top-killed T21) *)\nkap21 = Factor[sing1[\"21\", \"K2\"]/sing1[\"21\", \"S\"][[3]]];\nGrid[{{\"β(t), directions A\", βA}, {\"β(t), directions B\", βB}, {\"A = B ?\", Simplify[βA - βB] === 0}, {\"= (2t-3)/(t-1) (fitted earlier, h=1)?\", Simplify[βA - (2 tt - 3)/(tt - 1)] === 0},\n  {\"K21/S21 (singlet, plain top-killed T21)\", kap21}, {\"K11/S21\", Factor[sing1[\"11\", \"K2\"]/sing1[\"21\", \"S\"][[3]]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
