       "data": "Power::infy: Infinite expression -------- encountered.                                       -54                                  0. 10\nInfinity::indet: Indeterminate expression 0. 10    ComplexInfinity encountered.\nPower::infy: Infinite expression -------- encountered.                                       -54                                  0. 10\nInfinity::indet: Indeterminate expression 0. 10    ComplexInfinity encountered.",
