       "data": "Out[890]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\mu  & \\text{Baxter residuals (max)} & \\text{X11 = 3h²$\\chi$₃ r (max rel., all c)} & \\text{X21 = -3h³$\\chi$₃ $\\rho$ r (max rel., all c, j)}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2,2\\right\\} & 0.\\times 10^{-51} & 0.\\times 10^{-50} & 0.\\times 10^{-50}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & 0.\\times 10^{-51} & 0.\\times 10^{-51} & 0.\\times 10^{-51}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{Indeterminate} & 0.\\times 10^{-53} & 0.\\times 10^{-52}\\\\\\hline\\text{time (s)} & 0.231915 &  & \\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
