      {
       "data": "Out[901]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{rescaling g(u)} & \\text{g($\\theta$1-h)} & \\text{clean combination T\\textasciitilde{}21 + c T\\textasciitilde{}11 :  c =}\\\\\\hline\\text{none (raw T's)} & 1 & 2\\,\\mathrm{tt}-3\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\nu$1} & \\mathrm{tt}+1 & \\frac{2\\,\\mathrm{tt}-3}{\\mathrm{tt}+1}\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\nu$2} & 0 & \\text{singular: g vanishes at $\\theta$1-h}\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\nu$3} & 1-\\mathrm{tt} & -\\frac{2\\,\\mathrm{tt}-3}{\\mathrm{tt}-1}\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\nu$3(u-h/2) = $\\prod$\\_s(u-$\\theta$\\_s-h/2)} & -\\frac{3}{4}\\,\\left(2\\,\\mathrm{tt}-3\\right) & -\\frac{4}{3}\\\\\\hline\\text{f-normalized X's (localization factors)} & \\text{–} & \\frac{2\\,\\mathrm{tt}-3}{\\mathrm{tt}-1}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "19164e7f-abf2-43dd-892a-cf6e60009d3d"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result of Section 3** ($h=1$, exact). The clean coefficient $c$ in $\\tilde T_{(2,1)}+c\\,\\tilde T_{(1,1)}$, for each rescaling $g$:\n\n| $g(u)$ | $g(\\theta_1-h)$ | $c$ |\n|---|---|---|\n| none (raw $T$'s) | 1 | $2t-3$ |\n| $\\nu_1$ | $t+1$ | $\\frac{2t-3}{t+1}$ |\n| $\\nu_2$ | 0 | singular |\n| $\\nu_3$ | $-(t-1)$ | $-\\frac{2t-3}{t-1}$ |\n| $\\prod_s(u-\\theta_s-h/2)$ | $-\\frac34(2t-3)$ | $-\\frac43$ |\n| $f$-normalized | – | $\\frac{2t-3}{t-1}$ |\n\n**Conclusion.** None of the $\\nu_n$ works, and neither does the $f$-normalization. Rescaling each Lax operator by its half-shifted factor, $\\mathcal L^{(s)}(u)\\to\\mathcal L^{(s)}(u)/(u-\\theta_s-h/2)$, makes the clean combination $t$-independent:\n$$\\tilde{\\mathcal C}=\\tilde T_{(2,1)}(\\theta_1-2h)-\\tfrac43\\,\\tilde T_{(1,1)}(\\theta_1-2h).$$\nAmong rescalings by products of site factors $\\prod_s(u-\\theta_s+a_sh)$, the site-2 shift $a_2=-\\frac12$ is forced. The site-1 factor at $\\theta_1-h$ is only a constant, so $a_1$ affects the number $-4/3$ but not $t$-independence; $a_1=-\\tfrac12$ is the symmetric choice.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  }
 ],
